T*
(## 8\) ESP32 \(servo + buzzer + PIR\) ? `esp32/sapa_gate.ino`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Servo di GPIO 13, buzzer GPIO 14, PIR GPIO 27.) Tj
T*
(- Ubah `WIFI_SSID/PASS` dan `MQTT_HOST/USER/PASS` lalu flash via Arduino IDE.) Tj
T*
(- Subscribe `sapa/gate`:) Tj
T*
(  - `{"action":"open"}` ? servo ke OPEN_ANGLE, beep 1◊, hold sampai PIR mendeteksi pergerakan,) Tj
T*
(lalu close \(mirip KAI Access\).) Tj
T*
(  - `{"action":"close"}` ? servo ke CLOSED_ANGLE.) Tj
T*
(  - `{"action":"invalid"}` ? buzzer beep 2◊, servo tetap tutup.) Tj
T*
(- Publish `sapa/device/heartbeat` setiap 5s ? backend tahu device online.) Tj
T*
(- Publish `sapa/pir` saat PIR HIGH ? backend juga publish `close` ke gate \(server-side) Tj
T*
(fail-safe\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 8.1 ESP32 LAN ke broker) Tj
T*
(Gunakan `mosquitto-nodeport.yaml` \(NodePort 31883\), UFW allow `192.168.0.0/24` ke port itu,) Tj
T*
(MQTT_HOST = IP VPS LAN.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 8.2 ESP32 beda jaringan) Tj
T*
(Pasang gateway WireGuard / mini router yang join VPN, ESP32 connect ke gateway via LAN; gateway) Tj
T*
(forward ke broker via tunnel.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
